  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.06 Agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.06 “Agreement” means the written contract between:\n\n(a) An emergency medical service unit and its medical resource hospital, which covers procedures as defined in Saf-C 5919.01 and Saf-C 5920.02; or\n\n(b) An emergency medical services instructor coordinator and hospital or unit which allows for student clinical or field experience as a part of a division approved training program.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13953, eff 4-30-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
